                            <comment id="14233867" author="zhaijia" created="Thu, 4 Dec 2014 03:09:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I am preparing a patch for this issue. &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/smile.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14235037" author="zhaijia" created="Fri, 5 Dec 2014 04:26:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Here is the patch.&lt;br/&gt;
The test class, which not delete tmp dir, is got By searching the /tmp dir, and surefire-reports.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In most of the error, tmp file is managed as this below, and not deleted at the end:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-style: solid;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeHeader panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bar.java&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;      File tmpDir = File.createTempFile(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;bookie&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;test&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
      tmpDir.delete();
      tmpDir.mkdir();
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The fix is more or less like this, using a List to record the tmpdirs, and remove them at @After func:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-style: solid;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeHeader panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bar.java&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;final&lt;/span&gt; List&amp;lt;File&amp;gt; tempDirs = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; ArrayList&amp;lt;File&amp;gt;();

    File createTempDir(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; prefix, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; suffix) &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; IOException {
        File dir = IOUtils.createTempDir(prefix, suffix);
        tempDirs.add(dir);
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; dir;
    }

    @After
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; void tearDown() &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; Exception {
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (File dir : tempDirs) {
            FileUtils.deleteDirectory(dir);
        }
        tempDirs.clear();
    }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
</comment>
